Scope of this license
---------------------

The MIT license above covers the source code of this repository: the Python
scripts in scripts/, the notebooks in notebooks/, and the trained model
weights in models/.

The photographs in assets/field_targets/ were taken by the author during the
field campaign and are released under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International license (CC BY 4.0). They document the placement of the printed
targets on the cladodes; the printed sheets visible in them reproduce
third-party symptom photographs, which are not licensed by this repository.

The training images used to fit the model weights are NOT distributed here.
See DATASET.md.
